& [LedgerSolution] is pure content-addressed custody
  + AttentionLedger stores validated complete frames by lowercase SHA-256 digest in deterministic maps
  + each session binds one exact head sequence generation status event history and session digest
  + each event binds command response predecessor optional successor status and its own digest
  + root validation recomputes every nested digest walks each event chain and rejects orphan or multiply referenced events

& [ContinuationSolution] is compact explicit reentry
  + AttentionContinuation binds ledger identity and digest session identity and sequence exact head digest generation status and latest event
  + OPEN carries one complete frame while later APPLY calls resolve the base only from the current stored head
  + every command compares the global ledger root and APPLY also compares session sequence and head digest
  + equal repeated execution from an equal immutable ledger is byte-equal while replay against its successor is stale

& [OperationSolution] reuses the verified core
  + APPLY accepts only reconcile compact prepare or settle
  + the operation is translated into the existing provider-neutral SharedAttentionToolRequest and dispatched through the one shared core function
  + applied reconciliation compaction preparation and sealed settlement store and select their successor frame
  + buffered refused incomplete deferred and revision-required results append an exact event without advancing the head

& [HistorySolution] distinguishes admission from semantic advancement
  + every admitted OPEN or APPLY appends exactly one event and advances sequence exactly once
  + INSPECT READ_FRAME and READ_EVENT project exact retained state without a successor
  + stale unknown duplicate corrupt discontinuous or collision-shaped inputs refuse without a successor
  + no operation deletes a frame event or prior event reference

& [McpSolution] is one volatile serialized custodian
  + cantor-attention-ledger-mcp owns one process-local ledger behind an asynchronous mutex
  + continue_attention_session is the only STDIO tool and accepts the exact pure command union under request
  + structuredContent carries the complete result or typed fault and text remains a non-authoritative summary
  + mutations are serialized but all compare-and-set bindings remain mandatory and a same-head race admits at most one command
  + the combined tool declares mutating non-destructive non-idempotent closed-world metadata

& [MemoryBoundary] is external semantic state rather than neural state
  + a continuation reduces repeated base-frame transport but every frame and event remains exactly inspectable
  + no KV cache hidden state or mid-generation token stream is accessed
  + event admission records Cantor behavior and does not convert agreement refusal or settlement into external truth

& [Noninterference] is explicit
  + the stateless coordinate_attention adapter remains available as the restart-simple complete-payload path
  + no persistence network listener replication authentication signature model invocation registration effect execution or DreamFrame ledgering occurs

& [Disposition] is implemented_verified_local_volatile_reentry_P0
